(text "DAT board: sits in the 6809/6309 socket; the CPU plugs into J1 on top. All CPU pins pass straight through." (at 25.40 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b488e3dc-e406-4e1f-a542-d74f5f367302))
(text "U1 shadows writes to $FFA0-$FFAF (D7:D6), $FF90 (MMU enable, MC3), $FF91 (task), $FF9B (video bank), $FFD8/9 (speed)" (at 25.40 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 728a38d3-6f3f-4d25-bae4-dbd6c0ada8b4))
(text "and drives BANK1:0 = physical A20:A19 for each GIME slot. Logic: cpld/dat2m.v, pins: cpld/dat2m_top.v." (at 25.40 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 45d2868a-0081-433d-a582-ef7f674bb9a2))
(text "CPLD IO pin numbers above carry the signals named on their labels (assignment chosen for routing)." (at 25.40 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b7095b6e-16b5-451e-a737-95d76b53c8d5))
(text "J2 = 2x2 bank header like the GIME-Z: B0/B1 on pins 1/3, ground on 2/4 (R1/R2 100R protect against a wrong plug). J4 = turbo LED (+5V, cathode via R3); lit in fast mode." (at 25.40 50.80 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b45b45a2-21ed-4e29-99ac-d36450a34a07))
(text "neo-mem-compact - CC BY-SA 4.0." (at 25.40 256.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2631abcd-9280-4b3b-89be-53f48c2b6275))
